  <data key="d1">"Adam Smith is a character communicating with Li Hua about booking curtains, showing helpfulness and enthusiasm."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith is a character who is arranging the installation details for an air-conditioner and is flexible with scheduling to accommodate a colleague's work hours."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith is a person reminding about rent and offering assistance for any queries."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith is presumably Li Hua's acquaintance or landlord, offering to arrange for professional repair services."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith is providing information on the visit time and expressing his readiness to welcome Li Hua."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith is offering support and assistance before the construction begins, this Wednesday."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith offers to prepare for any weather-related construction delays."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith reiterates support for adding benches and inquires about community use plans for the garden."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith is an individual communicating with Li Hua about upcoming repairs, showing consideration for Li Hua's activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith is associated with the community and is looking for ways to lift spirits during delays."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith is a communicator reminding Li Hua about the contractor team's visit to install an AC in the basement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith is a user inquiring about the functionality of an air-conditioner in a basement during hot weather."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith is providing guidance on how to hang artwork without damaging the walls, showing a helpful and supportive attitude.&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith is a communicator who informs Li Hua about the delivery of a fridge."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith is a person who organized a key pickup for a basement meeting, demonstrating organizational skills."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith is a person willing to assist with the installation of sound-insulating pads in the basement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith is a considerate individual reminding Li Hua to keep noise down during late-night practice sessions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Adam Smith is a person agreeing to meet Li Hua to discuss the basement renovation."</data>
