tion is a concept mentioned in the context of the team interacting with an unknown intelligence, highlighting the importance of exchanging information."&lt;SEP&gt;"Effective communication among team members like Turalyon, IllidanStormrage, and MuradinBronzebeard is crucial for planning and organizing the tree planting activity, sharing ideas and ensuring everyone's tasks are effectively coordinated."&lt;SEP&gt;"Communication is highlighted in JenniferMoore's responsive dialogue with LiHua, ensuring understanding and agreement on the new training schedule."</data>
