<node id="&quot;COSMIC PLAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Cosmic Play is a metaphor for the grand narrative at play, with humanity's actions influencing events on a universal scale, potentially leading to significant consequences and thematic exploration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cosmic play alludes to the grand-scale events and themes involving humanity's place in the universe, as depicted in the storyline, often involving complex moral and existential considerations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cosmic play is a metaphor for the grand, almost theatrical scale of events involving humanity and the universe, reflecting themes of destiny and greatness."&lt;SEP&gt;"The phrase 'cosmic play' used by LiHua to describe humanity's response to the message from the heavens suggests a sense of grand adventure or significance, a theme that extends beyond the physical activity of working out."&lt;SEP&gt;"The phrase 'grand cosmic play' suggests a broader philosophical or poetic reflection on humanity's place, possibly including Li Hua and ChaeSong-hwa, part in the unfolding of events or history."&lt;SEP&gt;"The reference to humanity's role in the 'grand cosmic play' suggests a philosophical perspective on the larger significance and interconnectedness of life."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cosmic play alludes to the larger, existential context of humanity's involvement in the universe, suggesting the significance of their actions on a grand scale."&lt;SEP&gt;"Cosmic play is a metaphor LiHua uses to describe the significant and grand role their musical actions play in the broader context of human experience."&lt;SEP&gt;"The phrase 'cosmic play' is used by YurikoYamamoto to describe the grandeur of humanity's potential interactions with the unknown intelligence, indicating the significance of the subject matter."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fade2202630cd45a8f6ea3893c3c99df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb1b2128606f39607cb4d1e6ede509f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db78e24226822ad20b9a08c03efffd2a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83be19e889c1b5f4934b302ad4c000b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9ae7d7459b995b89837f01790edb4c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bc159d22cc23b35d9e2319b2d650b3f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ed7071e50d3dd4d1983881a761398af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92f77f0e135ee02bfea0acff12505bf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e92f03813e03e2fa384824e155beb6af</data>
