<node id="&quot;JETT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Jett agrees with LiHua's advice on marathon training and suggests dedicating specific days to different types of runs and emphasizing the importance of recovery."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett focuses on relaxation and mindful breathing to address discomfort during squats."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett offers advice on knee tracking and warming up joints to avoid discomfort during squats."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett looks for trails with varied scenery and clear markings for navigation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett expresses enthusiasm for sharing updates and celebrating everyone's progress, fostering a motivational group dynamic."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett expresses interest in adding yoga to their routine, seeking advice and experiences from others, indicating a peer-to-peer relationship with a strength score of 6 and keywords such as "expressing interest, seeking advice."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett expresses excitement about exploring yoga and observing changes in their workouts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett is encouraging group participation and sharing of fitness experiences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett looks forward to trying yoga, noting the balance it offers to workouts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett's anticipation of sharing experiences post-yoga demonstrates a forward-thinking and collaborative mindset."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett's openness to exploring yoga indicates an adaptable and proactive approach to personal fitness development."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett is an individual actively engaged in fitness discussions and seeks new workout methods to enhance stamina."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett is someone who values a strong conclusion to the week and actively seeks to improve endurance through breathing techniques."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett is positive and excited about establishing a routine and sharing progress, showing teamwork."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett employs visualization techniques for motivation during difficult workouts and expresses interest in sharing and receiving workout playlists."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett is enthusiastic about the idea of trying different playlists and sharing workout stories, showing a willingness to explore new motivations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett is excited about participating in the playlist-sharing challenge and expresses eagerness for the resulting variety in workouts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett shows interest in meal prepping as a strategy to overcome post-workout lethargy and to adhere to nutrition goals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett pays particular attention to hip flexors post-workouts, especially squats, using deep stretching and light massaging for recovery."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett enjoys burpees and mountain climbers in interval sessions for their heart-racing effect and muscle engagement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett recommends interval training for stamina building and shares his positive experience with it."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett discusses the need for routine variation and motivation, reflecting common challenges and solutions within fitness communities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett prefers 'Thunder' by Imagine Dragons for adrenaline, indicating its effectiveness for intense workout moments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett enjoys lunges and travel push-ups, and is interested in creating a specific circuit for outdoor sessions, highlighting the enjoyment of varied exercises and challenge."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett is a user discussing fitness routines and expressing a desire to start mirroring to improve posture and seeking recommendations for fitness channels and trainers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett is an active gym member who values stretching and incorporates it into their post-workout routine for recovery and flexibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett is an active participant in the fitness community, discussing workout goals, stretching benefits, and learning techniques like mirroring for form improvement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett is enthusiastic about trying single-leg hops to switch up his workout routine and improve fitness."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett prefers hip openers and shoulder dislocates for warm-up and agility, highlighting individual preferred exercises within the group."&lt;SEP&gt;"Jett feels more energized post-warm-up an