<node id="&quot;FOAM ROLLING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Foam Rolling is a technique used for muscle recovery and release, mentioned by Sova and Omen as a beneficial recovery tool."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foam rolling is a self-myofascial release technique using a foam roller to relieve muscle tension, improve flexibility, and aid in recovery, which is recommended by Viper for those looking to diversify their post-workout recovery methods."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foam rolling is listed by Phoenix as a method to ease muscle tension before and after squatting exercises."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foam rolling is suggested as a tool for soreness relief after workouts, which is a technique used to aid recovery and muscle flexibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foam rolling is a recovery technique mentioned by JenniferMoore as a method to help with muscle soreness prevention."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foam rolling is a recovery method discussed by several participants, praised for easing muscle tightness and improving overall recovery."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foam rolling is another recovery technique suggested by JenniferMoore to alleviate muscle soreness and improve flexibility."&lt;SEP&gt;"Foam Rolling is suggested as a method to alleviate muscle tightness and sore spots."</data>
