</node>
<node id="&quot;GAME DIFFICULTY BALANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Game Difficulty Balance is the equilibrium between challenge and player skill/strategy, which LiHua is keen on ensuring for a rewarding experience.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285391a15c889f82cd6b6263f347f59a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ENVIRONMENTAL INTERACTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Environmental Interactions pertain to the physical aspects of the game world affecting gameplay, such as collapsing buildings or causing explosions, which ThaneChambers suggests could create memorable combat experiences.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285391a15c889f82cd6b6263f347f59a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TELEPORTATION ABILITIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Teleportation Abilities are mentioned by Bronwyn as a tactical maneuver in combat, indicating a possible power for player movement and positioning.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285391a15c889f82cd6b6263f347f59a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIGHT-BASED ATTACKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Light-based Attacks are part of Caelum's imagined power combination, suggesting offensive capabilities that could add strategic depth to the combat system.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285391a15c889f82cd6b6263f347f59a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AREA ATTACKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Area Attacks as proposed by Bronwyn involve targeting multiple foes, indicating mechanics that could affect group versus enemy scenarios.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285391a15c889f82cd6b6263f347f59a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EPIC BOSS BATTLES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Epic Boss Battles, as Gavriel hopes for, would represent significant, challenging encounters likely to be a highlight in the game's combat narrative.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285391a15c889f82cd6b6263f347f59a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTELLIGENCE WRITING RULES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Intelligence Writing Rules refers to the advanced abilities of an unknown intelligence in the game narrative, posing a strategic and philosophical challenge for players.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285391a15c889f82cd6b6263f347f59a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ABILITY SYNERGY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ability Synergy involves combining different powers to create effective combat mechanics, which Aisling and Jareth both show interest in, suggesting a layer of depth for skillful player combinations.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285391a15c889f82cd6b6263f347f59a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PLAYER ADAPTATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Player Adaptation is LiHua's term for how players might adjust their strategies during combat, implying a dynamic and responsive gameplay experience.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285391a15c889f82cd6b6263f347f59a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COLLECTIVE EXPERIENCE SHARING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Collective Experience Sharing among the community members reflects the anticipation and excitement for the game post-release.</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-285391a15c889f82cd6b6263f347f59a</data>
</node>
