  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Orion agrees with Niamh's sentiment on Joffrey and adds Ramsay Bolton as another hateable character, showing agreement and engagement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Orion is skeptical about the possibility of reconciliation between Kendall and Logan, citing their toxic bond and Kendall's pattern of betrayals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Orion is skeptical about the possibility of reconciliation between Kendall and Logan, contributing to the exploration of the family's impact on Kendall's motivations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Orion is a user expressing a desire for collaborative efforts in justice reform, advocating for a council to address grievances of the common people."&lt;SEP&gt;"Orion supports Brienne's potential role as a mentor, acknowledging her influence on peacekeepers' morale and values."&lt;SEP&gt;"Orion appreciates the portrayal of moral decline in characters like Walter White from "Breaking Bad," finding the transformation both wild and relatable."&lt;SEP&gt;"Orion is contemplative about the potential moral dilemmas and regulatory challenges posed by advanced AI, focusing on the idea of a robot uprising."&lt;SEP&gt;"Orion is interested in how characters respond to new threats and the conflicts that arise from those responses."</data>
