<node id="&quot;MESSI&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Messi is celebrated for his playmaking ability and memorable solo goal against Getafe in 2007."&lt;SEP&gt;"Messi is highlighted for his incredible football skills and game-changing moments, serving as a subject of interest and aspiration for Jake Watson and Li Hua."&lt;SEP&gt;"Messi is praised by both JakeWatson and LiHua for his skills, goals, and impact on the club and football, with particular moments highlighted.</data>
