  <data key="d3">227.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"LiHua agrees to assist YurikoYamamoto with the feedback section, discussing design elements such as testimonials, color schemes, and deadlines."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and YurikoYamamoto are both planning to attend the Freelancer Group Meeting, sharing interest in topics that pertain to the freelance lifestyle."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and YurikoYamamoto coordinate the musical session's structure and encourage others, demonstrating mutual support and excitement."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and YurikoYamamoto have a collaborative relationship where LiHua is preparing a website to highlight YurikoYamamoto’s studio features, specifically therapy techniques and community outreach programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto is receiving assistance from LiHua for testing a feature on the studio homepage."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua is providing feedback and suggestions for the promotion of the "Automatically schedule available time" feature to YurikoYamamoto's studio clients."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and YurikoYamamoto have arranged a meeting to discuss the final website, indicating collaboration and preparation for feedback."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua's expression 'See you Thursday' is a farewell and an affirmation of the forthcoming meeting on Thursday for project feedback."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua's use of 'Awesome' expresses optimism towards YurikoYamamoto's anticipation for the presentation."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto responds positively to LiHua's invitation, showing engagement and agreement to the meeting."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and YurikoYamamoto have a connection through their shared interest in participating in music jam sessions, with LiHua extending an invitation."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua and YurikoYamamoto share excitement and camaraderie about the upcoming music session."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto and LiHua discuss looking forward to next week's session and contributing song ideas, indicating a joint creative endeavor."&lt;SEP&gt;"YurikoYamamoto and LiHua express excitement and preparation for the event, highlight