lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson invites LiHua to provide feedback on the new cheese flavor and possibly join a baking workshop, facilitating customer engagement."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson invites LiHua to the tasting session, leading to their mutual agreement to attend the event."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua provides feedback to HaileyJohnson about the bread delivery, indicating a positive relationship with a touch of enthusiasm."&lt;SEP&gt;"LiHua provides positive feedback on HaileyJohnson's chocolate hazelnut donuts, suggesting possible additions for the flavor lineup."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson and LiHua have a positive interaction regarding the pastries, with LiHua suggesting a new flavor and HaileyJohnson appreciating the idea."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson requests LiHua's help for the bread-tasting event, and LiHua accepts the invitation."&lt;SEP&gt;"HaileyJohnson seeks advice from LiHua regarding the balance of sweetness in her donuts, indicating a collaborative relationship focused on taste preference."</data>
